{"id":35606,"slug":"it-was-just-an-accident","title":"It Was Just an Accident","year":2025,"country":"Iran, France","duration":103,"spine":1317,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/35606-it-was-just-an-accident","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/4440b5db30ff783b457b1e81db12edfa/CjxjWBfGgYjnNSg58kcZZ05UPJcG5q_large.jpg","description":"In this Palme d’Or winner from the Iranian auteur Jafar Panahi, a chance encounter sets in motion an urgent moral thriller. When a stranded driver (Ebrahim Azizi) walks into his shop, mechanic Vahid (Vahid Mobasseri) believes he has come face-to-face with Eqbal, a notoriously brutal guard who tortured him during his political imprisonment. Gathering a band of fellow former inmates and other allies, Vahid sets out to take justice into his own hands—but does he have the right man? Shot in secret after Panahi’s longtime ban from filmmaking in his home country, It Was Just an Accident is a tour de force of sustained tension and mordant humor, provocatively shifting perspectives to examine vital questions of trauma and revenge.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jafar Panahi","slug":"jafar-panahi"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Vahid Mobasseri","role":"Vahid","slug":"vahid-mobasseri"},{"actor":"Mariam Afshari","role":"Shiva","slug":"mariam-afshari"},{"actor":"Ebrahim Azizi","role":"Eqbal","slug":"ebrahim-azizi"},{"actor":"Hadis Pakbaten","role":"Golrokh","slug":"hadis-pakbaten"},{"actor":"Majid Panahi","role":"Ali","slug":"majid-panahi"},{"actor":"Mohamad Ali Elyasmehr","role":"Hamid","slug":"mohamad-ali-elyasmehr"},{"actor":"Georges Hashemzadeh","role":"Salar","slug":"georges-hashemzadeh"},{"actor":"Delnaz Najafi","role":"The little girl","slug":"delnaz-najafi"},{"actor":"Afssaneh Najmabadi","role":"Eqbal’s wife","slug":"afssaneh-najmabadi"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Jafar Panahi","slug":"jafar-panahi"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Jafar Panahi","slug":"jafar-panahi"},{"role":"Produced by","pers